{"sourceUrl":"https://yjsy.ecnu.edu.cn/c7/d5/c42082a772053/page.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:53:17.312622+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://yjsy.ecnu.edu.cn/c7/d5/c42082a772053/page.htm","html":"<div><p><span><span><span>华东师范大学卓越工程师学院是学校直管的开放式、平台性机构，重点聚焦集成电路、生物医药、人工智能三大先导产业，主要承担国家工程硕博士培养改革专项、卓越工程师学院校企培养改革项目，坚持以行业企业真问题需求为牵引，聚焦“卡脖子”难题，以产教深度融合为重要突破口，探索校企育人资源融合与全过程联合培养新机制，推动企业全方位全过程参与人才培养，构建工程硕博士研究生培养新范式。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><br/></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>卓越工程师学院2027年接收优秀应届本科毕业生免试攻读研究生（含本科直博）的工作</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>即将启动，现将预报名工作安排通知如下：</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><br/></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><strong>一、报名条件</strong></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>1. </span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>中华人民共和国公民，拥护中国共产党领导，遵纪守法、品德良好；</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>2. </span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>已获得或预计获得就读学校推荐免试资格的优秀应届本科毕业生；</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>3. </span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>学习成绩优异，具有较强的创新意识、研究潜质和专业基础；</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>4. </span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>诚实守信，学风端正，无任何有违学术道德、专业伦理等行为；</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>5. </span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>身心健康，符合国家规定的体检要求。</span></span></span></span></p><p><br/></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><strong>二</strong></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><strong>、招生学科及报名流程</strong></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><strong>    （一）招生学科</strong></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span>招生专业<