程学院</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>东软载波</span></p></td><td><p><a href=\"https://faculty.ecnu.edu.cn/_s15/zrx/main.psp\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>张润曦</span></a></p></td><td><p><span>信息与电子工程学院</span></p></td></tr><tr><td rowspan=\"7\"><p><span>工程硕博士培养改革专项</span></p></td><td rowspan=\"4\"><p><span>硕士</span></p></td><td rowspan=\"4\"><p><span>全日制</span></p></td><td rowspan=\"4\"><p><span>专业学位</span></p></td><td><p><span>085403集成电路工程</span></p></td><td rowspan=\"7\"><p><span>具体企业请详见招生系统</span></p></td><td colspan=\"2\"><p><span>信息与电子工程学院</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>085405软件工程</span></p></td><td colspan=\"2\"><p><span>软件工程学院</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>085410人工智能</span></p></td><td colspan=\"2\"><p><span>信息与电子工程学院、数据科学与工程学院</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>085411大数据技术与工程</span></p></td><td colspan=\"2\"><p><span>数据科学与工程学院</span></p></td></tr><tr><td rowspan=\"3\"><p><span>博士</span></p></td><td rowspan=\"3\"><p><span>全日制</span></p></td><td rowspan=\"3\"><p><span>专业学位</span></p></td><td><p><span>085403集成电路工程</span></p></td><td colspan=\"2\"><p><span>信息与电子工程学院</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>085410人工智能</span></p></td><td colspan=\"2\"><p><span>软件工程学院</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>085411大数据技术与工程</span></p></td><td colspan=\"2\"><p><span>数据科学与工程学院</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p><br/></p><p><span><span><span>注：以上学科专业等信息仅供参考，我校</span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>2027</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>年推免专业目录最终以全国推荐免试攻读研究生（免初试、转段）信息公开管理服务系统（网址：</span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>https://yz.chsi.com.cn/tm/index.jsp</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>，以下简称推免服务系统）公布为准。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>有意向报名我院的考生可点击项目负</span></span></span><span>责</span><span>老师姓名跳转至老师主页，了解老师的研究方向，也可与老师发邮件咨询项目信息。</span></p><p><span><span><strong>招生专业</strong></span><span><span><strong>、</strong></span></span><span><span><strong>联培企业名单持续更新中，敬请</strong></span></span><span><strong>留意</strong></span><span><span><strong>。</strong></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><strong>（</strong></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><strong>二</strong></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><strong>）</strong></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><strong>报名</strong></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><strong>时间及方式</strong></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>学院预推免报名时间：</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><strong>2026</strong></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><strong>年</strong></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><strong>8</strong></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><strong>月</strong></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><strong>11</strong></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><strong>日</strong></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><strong>8:00—2026</strong></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><strong>年</strong></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><strong>9</strong></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><strong>月</strong></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><strong>1</strong></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><strong>0</strong></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><strong>日</strong></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><strong>17:00</strong></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>有意申请的考生可登录华东师范大学研究生报考服务系统（</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><a href=\"https://yjszs-ks.ecnu.edu.cn/logon?zsxm=5\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><span><span><span><span>https://yjszs-ks.ecnu.edu.cn/logon?zsxm=5</span></span></span></span></span></a></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>，以下简称报名系统）注册账号，填写并提交申请志愿。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>每考生最多可注册两个账号，填报两条独立志愿。在院系规定报名截止时间前，考生可自行取消提交状态、修改完善后再次提交。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><strong>（</strong></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><strong>三</strong></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><strong>）报名材料</strong></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>1. </span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>有效居民身份证；</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>2. </span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>教育部学籍在线验证报告；</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>3. </span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>预报名申请表（报名系统填写完毕后下载打印、签字后扫描上传）；</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>4. </span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>诚信承诺书（报名系统下载打印、签字后扫描上传）；</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>5.</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>个人陈述</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>6.</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>成绩单</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>7.</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>佐证材料（可选）</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>请注意：须保证提交材料真实、准确；无弄虚作假、学术不端。</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><br/></p><p><span><span><span><span><strong>三、其他说明</strong></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>1.</span></span></span></span></span><span><span>考生须保证提交材料真实、准确，不得弄虚作假，不得有学术不端行为。</span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>2.</span></span></span></span></span><span><span>考生须密切关注报名系统中的审核状态及学院复试通知等信息。学院将组织专家对申请材料进行审核，确认是否接收申请，并根据上级部门和学校政策规范组织复试考核工作。</span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>3.</span></span></span></span></span><span><span>除预报名外，所有通过推荐免试方式攻读学院</span></span><span><span><span><span><span>2027</span></span></span></span></span><span><span>年研究生的考生均须在正式取得推免资格后，在推免服务系统履行填写报考志愿、接收并确认院系的复试及待录取通知等正式程序。推免服务系统正式开放时间请及时关注中国研究生招生信息网相关公告。</span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>4.</span></span></span></span></span><span><span>错过预报名的考生如仍有意愿报考我院，可在推免服务系统开通后直接报名。学院将结合实际，确定是否再次组织推免复试考核与录取。</span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>5.</span></span></span></span></span><span><span>若上级部门对推免招生工作有新的要求，学院将遵照执行。</span></span></p><p><br/></p><p><a href=\"https://yjsy.ecnu.edu.cn/c7/d5/c42082a772053/page.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a><span><span><strong>四、</strong></span><span><strong>咨询方式</strong></span></span></p><ul><li><p><span>卓越工程师学院：秦老师，021-54836268，myqin@lps.ecnu.edu.cn；</span></p></li><li><p><span>中航工业（通信工程）、万达信息、海军航空大学、上海集成电路研发中心、武创大智、赛迈测控、东软载波、中国电子、上海华虹、长三角国创中心：尹老师，021-54836127，myin@cs.ecnu.edu.cn；</span></p></li><li><p><span>中航工业（软件工程）、中国商飞、振华重工：张老师，021-62232826，wqzhang@sei.ecnu.edu.cn；</span></p></li><li><p><span>华鑫股份、华为、蚂蚁集团、华东师范大学贵州（大数据应用）研究院、中国航信、武汉达梦数据：徐老师，021-62231630，dasezhaosheng@163.com；</span></p></li><li><p><span>图视智能、具身慧智、中航工业（计算机技术）：彭老师，021-62235021，yxpeng@cs.ecnu.edu.cn。</span></p></li></ul><p><br/></p><p><span>华东师范大学卓越工程师学院</span></p><p><span>     </span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>2026</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>年</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>8</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>10</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>日</span></span></span></span></p><p><br/></p><p><br/></p></div>","textSha256":"8204cab07925aade2606eec0705e16fb4e33b2c46a2453b439d70eeda635b208","textLength":2346,"sourceSha256":"0c46031d3f956970988cb379bb33e1ec28e27472fa768da94f91e7fc8923c463","selector":".wp_articlecontent","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-2a9c9b8d8d9a060e4252","title":"2026年华东师范大学卓越工程师学院2027年接收优秀应届本科毕业生免试攻读研究生（含直接攻博）预报名通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:53:17.312622+00:00"}
